    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, you're saying the privilege side is more persuasive? I thought the whole point of checks and balances was to prevent the executive from becoming too powerful. If I try to argue the other side—that expanding privilege is basically just a way to dodge accountability and undermine Congress—am I just making a weak argument? Is there even a real legal basis for the opposition, or is it just political posturing?",
